      "content": "6.3 Folk Music and Instruments"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kqfsnj6",
      "content": "Uttarakhand has a rich tradition of folk music. Garhwali and Kumaoni are the two main folk music streams, each with distinct styles."
    },
