    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dpmd0g4",
      "content": "Notable litterateurs: Sumitranandan Pant (born Kausani, Almora) — Mahaprayan of modern Hindi poetry; Padma Bhushan recipient. Gumani Pant — pioneer of Kumaoni literature. Lokesh Ohri, Abodh Bandhu Bahuguna — Garhwali writers. Shailesh Matiyani — noted Hindi short story writer from Almora."
    },
